1054
01:08:29,320 --> 01:08:30,320
Australia?

1055
01:08:30,320 --> 01:08:38,320
Australia. Surely that couldn't be exposed so easily. Was there such a new feature?

1056
01:08:38,320 --> 01:08:40,320
Right. This one...

1057
01:08:40,320 --> 01:08:42,320
But somehow...

1058
01:08:42,320 --> 01:08:43,320
Australia?

1059
01:08:43,320 --> 01:08:44,320
Mm-hmm.

1060
01:08:44,320 --> 01:08:45,320
It sounds plausible.

1061
01:08:45,320 --> 01:08:47,320
It does!

1062
01:08:47,320 --> 01:08:59,320
