1063
01:08:59,320 --> 01:09:03,320
Does Nijisanji even have an Australian studio branch?

1064
01:09:03,320 --> 01:09:07,320
Surely not.

1065
01:09:07,320 --> 01:09:08,320
Huh?

1066
01:09:08,320 --> 01:09:12,320
