1067
01:09:12,320 --> 01:09:19,320
It somehow sounds possible, but surely...

1068
01:09:19,320 --> 01:09:23,320
False!

1069
01:09:23,320 --> 01:09:27,320
And the answer is... yes? true!

1070
01:09:27,320 --> 01:09:29,320
It was true!

1071
01:09:29,320 --> 01:09:31,320
Apparently so.

1072
01:09:31,320 --> 01:09:41,320
She eventually addressed it herself as a kind of confession: she really does live in Australia.

1073
01:09:41,320 --> 01:09:44,320
Seriously?

1074
01:09:44,320 --> 01:09:54,320
Apparently she hadn't mentioned it until she was exposed, so everyone wondered why and it caused quite a stir.

1075
01:09:54,320 --> 01:09:55,320
What?

1076
01:09:55,320 --> 01:10:00,320
Does she still live there? When did this happen?

1077
01:10:00,320 --> 01:10:07,320
Does she still? Chat, could you tell us?

1078
01:10:07,320 --> 01:10:09,320
When was this?

1079
01:10:09,320 --> 01:10:10,320
She visits Japan often, so nobody realized.

1080
01:10:10,320 --> 01:10:12,320
Apparently she still does.

1081
01:10:12,320 --> 01:10:15,320
I see.

1082
01:10:15,320 --> 01:10:19,320
That's a genuinely surprising event.

1083
01:10:19,320 --> 01:10:21,320
Far too surprising!

1084
01:10:21,320 --> 01:10:22,320
But this is...

1085
01:10:22,320 --> 01:10:23,320
How common is this, actually?

1086
01:10:23,320 --> 01:10:24,320
Right!

1087
01:10:24,320 --> 01:10:25,320
Exactly!

1088
01:10:25,320 --> 01:10:31,320
It's one of the strengths of being a Nijisanji Liver: nobody knows where you're streaming from.

1089
01:10:31,320 --> 01:10:32,320
Mm-hmm.

1090
01:10:32,320 --> 01:10:38,320
Unless you say otherwise, everyone naturally assumes you're in Japan. That's fascinating.

1091
01:10:38,320 --> 01:10:41,320
True.

1092
01:10:41,320 --> 01:10:43,320
You really can do this from anywhere.

1093
01:10:43,320 --> 01:10:48,320
Here is the next one.

1094
01:10:48,320 --> 01:10:49,320
