1114
01:11:54,320 --> 01:11:55,320
Mm-hmm.

1115
01:11:55,320 --> 01:12:07,320
I collected responses through a form with a separate field identifying each as true or false, right, but before checking that field, I completely believed this one.

1116
01:12:07,320 --> 01:12:09,320
Of course you would.

1117
01:12:09,320 --> 01:12:11,320
