1131
01:13:07,320 --> 01:13:10,320
Yes, I introduced her for April Fools' Day.

1132
01:13:10,320 --> 01:13:14,320
She genuinely startled me. I couldn't believe my eyes.

1133
01:13:14,320 --> 01:13:16,320
That makes sense—Mysterious Mito.

1134
01:13:16,320 --> 01:13:24,320
She's appeared in all sorts of places, but I don't often hear how other Livers felt the first time they saw her.

1135
01:13:24,320 --> 01:13:25,320
Really?

1136
01:13:25,320 --> 01:13:26,320
No.

1137
01:13:26,320 --> 01:13:32,320
Honestly, I realized that Mito-san was not normal.

1138
01:13:32,320 --> 01:13:35,320
So that was your reaction.

1139
01:13:35,320 --> 01:13:39,320
