1144
01:13:55,320 --> 01:14:00,320
Mysterious Lulu! I want to see it, but I also don't want you to do it.

1145
01:14:00,320 --> 01:14:06,320
I'm curious, but the barrier to doing it would be far too high.

1146
01:14:06,320 --> 01:14:09,320
Still, I'd like to see it.

1147
01:14:09,320 --> 01:14:17,320
Mysterious Mito has appeared all over, but could she really appear right, to throw the ceremonial first pitch?

1148
01:14:17,320 --> 01:14:18,320
Right.

1149
01:14:18,320 --> 01:14:19,320
That's quite a claim.

1150
01:14:19,320 --> 01:14:23,320
So... for this one, which do you think it is?

1151
01:14:23,320 --> 01:14:26,320
Not false—true.

1152
01:14:26,320 --> 01:14:31,320
Believe it or not, this one is false.

1153
01:14:31,320 --> 01:14:32,320
Wait, what?

1154
01:14:32,320 --> 01:14:37,320
Mysterious Mito's appearance wasn't actually the ceremonial first pitch.

1155
01:14:37,320 --> 01:14:39,320
But she did throw a pitch, didn't she?

1156
01:14:39,320 --> 01:14:44,320
Yes, but a “first pitch” event isn't the same as the ceremonial opening pitch.

1157
01:14:44,320 --> 01:14:45,320
