1158
01:14:45,320 --> 01:14:47,320
What Mysterious Mito did was specifically a “first pitch” event.

1159
01:14:47,320 --> 01:14:48,320
There's a distinction?

1160
01:14:48,320 --> 01:14:49,320
Yes.

1161
01:14:49,320 --> 01:14:53,320
