1175
01:15:34,320 --> 01:15:36,320
I wouldn't have known unless someone explained it.

1176
01:15:36,320 --> 01:15:40,320
They specifically told me not to call it the ceremonial first pitch.

1177
01:15:40,320 --> 01:15:43,320
I see—the difference is whether you meet the players.

1178
01:15:43,320 --> 01:15:44,320
Exactly.

1179
01:15:44,320 --> 01:15:45,320
Wow.

1180
01:15:45,320 --> 01:15:46,320
Mysterious Mito is a tragic monster.

1181
01:15:46,320 --> 01:15:47,320
The monster Mysterious Mito.

1182
01:15:47,320 --> 01:15:52,320
A tragic monster who cannot meet people and must never descend into human settlements.

1183
01:15:52,320 --> 01:15:55,320
Poor thing.

1184
01:15:55,320 --> 01:15:56,320
Still, she's been very active.

1185
01:15:56,320 --> 01:15:58,320
That honest reaction surprised me all over again.

1186
01:15:58,320 --> 01:16:01,320
Yes. I think this is the first time I've told that story.

1187
01:16:01,320 --> 01:16:02,320
Mm-hmm.

1188
01:16:02,320 --> 01:16:09,320
Now then, shall we do the final one?

1189
01:16:09,320 --> 01:16:10,320
Yes.

1190
01:16:10,320 --> 01:16:12,320
