1200
01:16:39,320 --> 01:16:41,320
Then again, it may be exactly right.

1201
01:16:41,320 --> 01:16:43,320
Who knows?

1202
01:16:43,320 --> 01:16:45,320
Can I answer now?

1203
01:16:45,320 --> 01:16:47,320
All right: true.

1204
01:16:47,320 --> 01:16:53,320
And this one was... true!

1205
01:16:53,320 --> 01:16:59,320
You don't sound happy at all about guessing correctly.

1206
