Strictly speaking, I'm not sure whether Maimoto-san himself specified that period, but according to the listener's source, he said so on day 28 of his one-on-one drinking series with Hayase-san, in Part 86.

1207
01:17:13,320 --> 01:17:14,320
[Laughter]

1208
01:17:14,320 --> 01:17:16,320
Sadly, it was true.

1209
01:17:16,320 --> 01:17:27,320
I almost wanted it to be false, but I remembered seeing something about it.

1210
01:17:27,320 --> 01:17:31,320
A very sad conclusion.

1211
01:17:31,320 --> 01:17:33,320
But perhaps... we can declare it false anyway.

1212
01:17:33,320 --> 01:17:37,320
Lulu-san, did you learn what happened while you were away from Nijisanji?

1213
01:17:37,320 --> 01:17:41,320
Yes. I learned several unexpected and shocking things.

1214
01:17:41,320 --> 01:17:42,320
Right.

1215
01:17:42,320 --> 01:17:43,320
Like Australia and the distinction between the two first-pitch events.

1216
01:17:43,320 --> 01:17:44,320
There were quite a few surprises.

1217
01:17:44,320 --> 01:17:45,320
Exactly.

1218
01:17:45,320 --> 01:17:46,320
Now you know a little more.

1219
01:17:46,320 --> 01:17:47,320
Yes.

1220
01:17:47,320 --> 01:17:48,320
One more gap in your knowledge has been filled.

1221
01:17:48,320 --> 01:17:54,320
And now, Lulu-san, regarding your future activities in Nijisanji—Ah!

1222
01:17:54,320 --> 01:17:55,320
Ah!

1223
01:17:55,320 --> 01:17:56,320
Ah!

1224
01:17:56,320 --> 01:17:57,320
Fireworks!

1225
01:17:57,320 --> 01:17:58,320
The fireworks!

1226
01:17:58,320 --> 01:17:59,320
Amazing!

1227
01:17:59,320 --> 01:18:00,320
Look!

1228
01:18:00,320 --> 01:18:01,320
Look!

1229
01:18:01,320 --> 01:18:02,320
Tamaya!

1230
01:18:02,320 --> 01:18:03,320
Da-da-da-da!

1231
01:18:03,320 --> 01:18:04,320
Da-da-da-da!

1232
01:18:04,320 --> 01:18:05,320
Da-da!

1233
01:18:05,320 --> 01:18:10,320
May I go to the restroom for a moment?

1234
01:18:10,320 --> 01:18:11,320
Come back quickly!

1235
01:18:11,320 --> 01:18:12,320
You'd better come right back!

1236
01:18:12,320 --> 01:18:13,320
Come right back!

1237
01:18:13,320 --> 01:18:15,320
Okay, I'll be right back.

1238
01:18:15,320 --> 01:18:16,320
Come back quickly!

1239
01:18:16,320 --> 01:18:17,320
Sorry to leave during such a beautiful view.

1240
01:18:17,320 --> 01:18:18,320
You'd better come right back!

1241
01:18:18,320 --> 01:18:20,320
The fireworks are beautiful.

1242
01:18:22,320 --> 01:18:24,320
Such beautiful fireworks.

1243
01:18:24,320 --> 01:18:29,320
